  "body": "Text around the `img` element sometimes talks about the `img` element being in a state. However, the states are only defined for an \"image request\", two of which can be associated with an `img` element. Presumably this needs to refer to the `img` element's current request's state, but it would be good to have that confirmed by @zcorpan.",
